asr-000052
00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:24.920
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Honorable members, distinguished colleagues and esteemed guests, good afternoon.

asr-000053
00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:28.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: We welcome our guests from the Department of Justice,

asr-000054
00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.520
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: led by Secretary Fredderick A. Vida,

asr-000055
00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.100
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: together with the heads of its attached agencies.

asr-000056
00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:35.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Today, we deliberate on the proposed

asr-000057
00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: budget of the Department of Justice

asr-000058
00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:41.000
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and its attached agencies for fiscal year 2027

asr-000059
00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:47.080
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: with a total obligation budget of 46.435 billion pesos,

asr-000060
00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:49.520
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: inclusive of automatic appropriations.

asr-000061
00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:56.560
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: This represents only 0.68% of the 7.2 trillion peso national budget

asr-000062
00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:01.840
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and is about 2% higher than the previous budget.

asr-000063
00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:05.000
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: In 2025, the DOJ recorded important operational gains.

asr-000064
00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:31.120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: The National Prosecution Service handled 428,779 cases and disposed or resolved 395,780, a 99.12% disposition rate, while the prosecution success rate improved to 90.84%. The NBI also conducted 56,212 investigations

asr-000065
00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:35.120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and processed 6.62 million clearance applications.

asr-000066
00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:41.460
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: While the PCGG reported about 1.57 billion pesos in recoveries

asr-000067
00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:45.920
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and income from surrendered or sequestered assets.

asr-000068
00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:50.920
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: These gains, however, must be sustained amid significant resource pressures.

asr-000069
00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:54.080
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Under the fiscal year 2027 NEP,

asr-000070
00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:58.840
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: the Bureau of Immigration budget is reduced by 35.8%,

asr-000071
00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:01.740
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: the NBI by 22.3%,

asr-000072
00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:05.060
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and the Office for Alternative Dispute Resolution,

asr-000073
00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:07.220
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: by 16.3%.

asr-000074
00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.680
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: In DOJ OSEC,

asr-000075
00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:11.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: funding for the

asr-000076
00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:14.720
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Special Enforcement and Protection Subprogram

asr-000077
00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: is reduced by almost half,

asr-000078
00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.380
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: including lower allocations for anti-trafficking,

asr-000079
00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:20.980
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: anti-cybercrime,

asr-000080
00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:22.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and OSAEC-CSAEM.

asr-000081
00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:28.200
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: The corrections program also faces a 21.05% reduction,

asr-000082
00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:31.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: including a cut in victims' compensation services

asr-000083
00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: from 19 million to 8 million pesos.

asr-000084
00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:36.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: At the same time,

asr-000085
00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:40.720
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 68.32% of the Department's

asr-000086
00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:42.780
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: fiscal year 2027 budget is for

asr-000087
00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:44.300
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: personal services,

asr-000088
00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.280
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: while leaving 24.42% for MOOE

asr-000089
00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:52.240
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and only 7.26% for capital outlay.

asr-000090
00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.880
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: The Committee must therefore determine

asr-000091
00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.920
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: whether the proposed budget can preserve

asr-000092
00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:58.940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: the DOJ's 2025 gains

asr-000093
00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:01.860
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: while addressing heavy caseloads,

asr-000094
00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:04.060
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: prison decongestion,

asr-000095
00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.020
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: border control,

asr-000096
00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.200
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: investigative capacity,

asr-000097
00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:07.640
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: cybercrime and trafficking,

asr-000098
00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:09.880
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: victim compensation,

asr-000099
00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:11.180
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and access to justice.

asr-000100
00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:12.760
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: We look forward to the Department's

asr-000101
00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:14.020
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: clarification of these challenges,

asr-000102
00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.700
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: its priorities for fiscal year 2027,

asr-000103
00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:18.800
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and the measurable results

asr-000104
00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:20.460
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: it expects to deliver

asr-000105
00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: with the resources proposed.

asr-000106
00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:24.440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you po.

