asr-000156
00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.350
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: Good afternoon.

asr-000157
00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.510
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: The Department's overarching framework

asr-000158
00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:21.850
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: is defined by its core mandate

asr-000159
00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.630
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: to uphold the rule of law

asr-000160
00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:26.710
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: and serve as the Department's principal law agency.

asr-000161
00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.870
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: In pursuit of its vision

asr-000162
00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:31.810
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: to foster a just and peaceful society

asr-000163
00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:33.630
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: rooted in transparency,

asr-000164
00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:34.450
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: accountability,

asr-000165
00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.190
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: fairness, and truth,

asr-000166
00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:38.490
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: the Department executes its mission,

asr-000167
00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.810
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: by delivering an effective,

asr-000168
00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:41.550
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: efficient,

asr-000169
00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:44.990
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: and equitable administration of justice nationwide.

asr-000170
00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:46.590
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: The Department

asr-000171
00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:49.270
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: administers the criminal justice system

asr-000172
00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.330
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: through the investigation of crimes,

asr-000173
00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:53.290
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: the prosecution of offenders,

asr-000174
00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:56.410
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: and the administration of the correctional system.

asr-000175
00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:58.350
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: Beyond criminal justice,

asr-000176
00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.290
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: the Department also maintains oversight

asr-000177
00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:03.170
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: over immigration,

asr-000178
00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:04.170
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: citizenship,

asr-000179
00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:06.190
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: and land titling system.

asr-000180
00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:07.570
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: Above all,

asr-000181
