00:43:37.920 --> 00:43:44.670
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: nasa proseso kami ng negotiations. But maliban po

asr-000668
00:43:44.680 --> 00:43:51.750
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: dito kami po ay masusing nakikipag-usap na ho sa ibang ahensya upang mailatag

asr-000669
00:43:51.760 --> 00:43:58.792
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: po namin yung iba't ibang titles na nai-issue na at malaman kung ano-ano ang mga meron pong overlapping.

asr-000670
00:43:59.348 --> 00:44:00.589
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sige po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000671
00:44:00.599 --> 00:44:03.510
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Um, aware po kayo sa JAO No. 1?

asr-000672
00:44:03.520 --> 00:44:04.175
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po ba?

asr-000673
00:44:04.715 --> 00:44:05.356
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: Opo. Opo.

asr-000674
00:44:05.727 --> 00:44:08.309
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano pong definition nitong JAO No. 1?

asr-000675
00:44:08.461 --> 00:44:10.630
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: Iyong pong JAO, naabutan ko po ito.

asr-000676
00:44:10.640 --> 00:44:14.190
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: Ito po ay interagency issuance po.

asr-000677
00:44:14.200 --> 00:44:18.910
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: Patungkol po ito, kung hindi po ako nagkakamali, dito po

asr-000678
00:44:18.920 --> 00:44:22.510
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: sa DAR sa DAR kung saan

asr-000679
00:44:22.520 --> 00:44:25.950
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: nagkaroon ng ah

asr-000680
00:44:25.960 --> 00:44:29.790
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: ugnayan para makapag-issue po ng mga

asr-000681
00:44:29.800 --> 00:44:32.963
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: titulo ho sa ilalim ng DAR.

asr-000682
00:44:36.085 --> 00:44:45.790
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay. Linawin ko lang, ang JAO No. 1 ay ito iyong mga ahensya na involved patungkol sa

asr-000683
00:44:45.800 --> 00:44:55.309
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pagbibigay ng titulo sa mga lupain. Kasama na diyan ang NCIP, DENR, DAR, at ang alam ko po ay kasama rin ang LRA dito.

asr-000684
00:44:55.319 --> 00:44:55.750
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: Opo.

asr-000685
00:44:55.760 --> 00:45:10.797
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay. Now, follow-up question po. Ano po iyong ginagawa ninyo kasalukuyan diyan bilang parte po kayo ng JAO para masiguro na hindi na nagkakaroon ng overlapping dahil itong tatlong ahensya ay hindi nagkakasundo?

asr-000686
00:45:10.848 --> 00:45:25.349
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: Opo. Iyong pong JAO No. 1, lumabas po doon ang NCIP. Nagkaroon po tayo ng panibagong pag-uusap sa ilalim ng leadership ng dati nating kalihim ng Katarungan.

asr-000687
00:45:25.359 --> 00:45:42.067
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: Nagkaroon ho ng ugnayan dito pero hindi ho nagbunga sa panibagong usapin ano ho but sa kasalukuyan tinutuloy po namin ang usapin para magkaroon tayo ng konkretong aksyon o policy regarding po itong overlapping of titles po.

asr-000688
00:45:43.298 --> 00:45:51.990
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, sana nga po magkaroon kayo ng commitment. Kung maaari, ma-commit ninyo rin po ngayon na sana ipagpatuloy

asr-000689
00:45:52.000 --> 00:46:02.190
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: natin iyong pag-coordinate dito sa mga ahensyang ito, nang sa gayon, pagdating po diyan sa LRA, wala na po siyang problema.

asr-000690
00:46:02.200 --> 00:46:08.630
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So anyway, dadako naman po ako kasi may 30 seconds na lang po ako. Dadako ako sa isa pang katanungan.

asr-000691
00:46:08.640 --> 00:46:18.950
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Noong July 16, 2026, nakipagpulong po sa inyo si Datu Rolando Anglao ng Manobo Pulangiyon in Bukidnon.

asr-000692
00:46:18.960 --> 00:46:25.710
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ayon sa kanyang pagkaunawa, kayang ilabas ng inyong tanggapan ang

asr-000693
00:46:25.720 --> 00:46:33.349
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: certificate of no overlap o CNO para sa CADT 261 ng Manobo Pulangiyon sa loob ng buwang ito.

asr-000694
00:46:33.359 --> 00:46:43.030
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Batid nating malinis na ang lots 1 at 2 at ang tanging hinahabol ng NCIP ay ang maisama ang lot 3 upang mabuo na ang 1,111 ektarya ng kanilang ancestral domain.

asr-000695
00:46:43.040 --> 00:46:51.473
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya ba ninyong i-issue ang CNO ngayong buwan?

asr-000696
00:46:51.777 --> 00:47:00.670
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: Ang lilinawin ko lang po, iyong certificate of lot status po, mayroon po kaming dependency rin po sa DENR.

asr-000697
00:47:00.680 --> 00:47:09.563
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: Assuming po na makapagbigay po sa amin ng hinihiling naming mga technical description or records from DENR, maaari po naming mailabas iyan.

asr-000698
00:47:11.774 --> 00:47:14.575
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ibig sabihin po, kaya ninyong maibigay ngayong buwan?

asr-000699
00:47:14.575 --> 00:47:15.700
LRA Administrator Gerardo P. Sirios: Pipilitin po natin.

asr-000700
00:47:15.900 --> 00:47:19.030
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay po. Sige po. At sana nga po, Mr.

asr-000701
00:47:19.040 --> 00:47:21.829
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Chair ma-providan niyo rin po kami ng update

asr-000702
00:47:21.839 --> 00:47:26.870
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: patungkol diyan kasi last ah budget cycle pa po yan namin fina-follow up.

asr-000703
00:47:26.880 --> 00:47:29.390
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana nga po ay maka-receive kami.

asr-000704
00:47:29.400 --> 00:47:31.197
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Anyway, Mr. Chair, maraming salamat po.

asr-000705
00:47:31.450 --> 00:47:33.589
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you, Rep. Ismula.

asr-000706
00:47:33.599 --> 00:47:38.950
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Reminder lang iyong mga reports po na hinihingi po ni Representative Ismula.

asr-000707
00:47:38.960 --> 00:47:43.533
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: kindly furnish the committee and her office po of the report po.

asr-000708
00:47:47.060 --> 00:47:53.405
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Next in line from the majority, Representative J.P. Padernos.

asr-000709
00:48:00.430 --> 00:48:05.150
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Magandang hapon po sa inyong lahat sa ating Department of Justice,

asr-000710
00:48:05.900 --> 00:48:11.210
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: headed by our Secretary Vida, and all attached agencies.

asr-000711
00:48:11.370 --> 00:48:12.320
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Magandang hapon po.

asr-000712
00:48:15.910 --> 00:48:21.040
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Mr. Chair, magtatanong lang po ako per agency para mas concrete.

asr-000713
00:48:22.070 --> 00:48:24.280
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: I'll start with the Bureau of Corrections.

asr-000714
00:48:24.280 --> 00:48:25.720
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Is DG Katapang here?

asr-000715
00:48:27.060 --> 00:48:27.220
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Ayan.

asr-000716
00:48:27.220 --> 00:48:36.640
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: I want to discuss yung facility decongestion and regionalization program ng DOJ.

asr-000717
00:48:37.630 --> 00:48:43.830
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Pangangailangan po kasi ng BUCOR ang humigit kumulang 55 billion para sa regional facilities,

asr-000718
00:48:44.520 --> 00:48:54.610
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: pero 676 million lang po ang capital outlay nito habang nasa 387% ang overcrowding sa NBP.

asr-000719
00:48:54.610 --> 00:48:56.580
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Sa ganitong pondo, paano po?

asr-000720
00:48:56.840 --> 00:49:00.430
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Maabot ang target na full closure ng NBP by 2028?

asr-000721
00:49:01.900 --> 00:49:06.220
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Mr. Chair, Congressman Padernos,

asr-000722
00:49:07.740 --> 00:49:11.200
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: nabigyan naman po kami ng pondo ng ating gobyerno.

asr-000723
00:49:12.020 --> 00:49:16.330
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Pag pinagsama-sama, simula ng 2022 hanggang ngayon,

asr-000724
00:49:16.330 --> 00:49:24.330
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: sama pa rin yung hopefully maipasa po yung 472 capital outlay for the...

asr-000725
00:49:26.910 --> 00:49:29.430
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: maximum security sa [unclear].

asr-000726
00:49:30.090 --> 00:49:33.010
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Pag sinama-sama po yun, more than 5 billion po yun.

asr-000727
00:49:34.000 --> 00:49:43.800
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: At ang capacity po na mangyayari na madadagdag is 11,390 additional PDL capacity.

asr-000728
00:49:43.800 --> 00:49:51.800
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: So itong 2025, nadagdagan tayo ng capacity na 1,000.

asr-000729
00:49:52.120 --> 00:49:54.690
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: 2026, 2005.

asr-000730
00:49:55.070 --> 00:49:56.790
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: 2027, 6,000.

asr-000731
00:49:56.890 --> 00:49:57.430
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: 210.

asr-000732
00:49:58.070 --> 00:49:59.950
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: And 2028, 1,600.

asr-000733
00:50:01.910 --> 00:50:09.870
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Alam po namin na hindi po kayang ibigay lahat ang kailangan namin para lang ma-address yung decongestion.

asr-000734
00:50:10.670 --> 00:50:19.780
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Pero ang maganda pong nangyayari, nire-repair po namin yung mga sira naming kulungan at nakakatulong po.

asr-000735
00:50:20.100 --> 00:50:23.760
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Ang report po na sinasite nyo is yung last year pa po yan.

asr-000736
00:50:23.760 --> 00:50:28.540
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Pero ngayon, sa NBP po,

asr-000737
00:50:28.860 --> 00:50:34.440
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: from 350%, ngayon po, 180% na lang ang congestion.

asr-000738
00:50:34.740 --> 00:50:36.230
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: So, kaya nga po,

asr-000739
00:50:36.990 --> 00:50:42.630
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: iniimbitahan namin kayo para makita nyo kung saan na pupunta yung sinusuporta nyo sa amin.

asr-000740
00:50:42.990 --> 00:50:47.210
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: And surely, we will also look for other ways.

asr-000741
00:50:47.410 --> 00:50:50.670
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Yung aming property po dito sa New Bilibid Prison,

asr-000742
00:50:50.670 --> 00:50:58.220
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: sa Muntinlupa, humihingi po kami ng permission na ipa-lease na.

asr-000744
00:50:58.840 --> 00:51:06.240
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Kasi po, yung Muntinlupa po, it should be repurposed.

asr-000745
00:51:06.520 --> 00:51:09.720
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Napaikutan na po kami ng mga first-class subdivision.

asr-000746
00:51:10.440 --> 00:51:17.710
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: So, ang inisip namin ay gamitin ito for better use para tumakbo ang economy.

asr-000747
00:51:17.710 --> 00:51:28.230
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: And hopefully, may mga targets kaming ine-expect na kung mapapa-lease namin ito for the next five years, makaka-generate kami ng 8 billion.

asr-000749
00:51:28.830 --> 00:51:32.570
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: So, yung po, ang ginagawa namin.

asr-000750
00:51:32.790 --> 00:51:38.040
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Alam po namin na hindi kaya ng ating gobyerno ibigay lahat ang kailangan ng Bucor.

asr-000751
00:51:38.200 --> 00:51:41.580
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Pero, I think we are doing our best.

asr-000752
00:51:41.580 --> 00:51:48.040
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: For the past four years, we have already turned around the congestion problem in Bucor.

asr-000753
00:51:49.590 --> 00:51:52.450
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Mr. Chair, napakagandang balita po niyan.

asr-000754
00:51:52.580 --> 00:51:56.160
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: So, can you repeat lang, DG Katapang?

asr-000755
00:51:56.350 --> 00:51:57.750
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Yung from...

asr-000756
00:51:58.330 --> 00:51:58.800
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Ilan po?

asr-000757
00:51:58.800 --> 00:52:04.590
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: From 387% overcrowding, nasa 187 na lang po?

asr-000758
00:52:04.620 --> 00:52:06.120
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Opo, sa NBP po.

asr-000759
00:52:06.280 --> 00:52:11.050
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Kasi, kailangan po talagang dahan-dahanin ko na ang paglipat.

asr-000760
00:52:11.050 --> 00:52:17.430
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: So, yung mga napagawa naman natin na outside Metro Manila, doon po sila nililipat.

asr-000761
00:52:18.190 --> 00:52:26.000
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: So, but overall, sa buong pagsamasamahin lahat yung ating mga kulungan, 204 na lang po ang congestion rate.

asr-000762
00:52:27.400 --> 00:52:28.480
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Sana lang po, Mr.

asr-000763
00:52:28.520 --> 00:52:33.250
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Mr. Chair, tulad po nang nabanggit ko last year sa ating budget deliberation,

asr-000764
00:52:33.810 --> 00:52:44.620
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: let's keep in mind lang po sana yung mga pamilya na siyempre karamihan naman po ng mga nade-detain is from NCR.

asr-000765
00:52:45.120 --> 00:52:51.690
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: So, sana po hindi sila ma-displace in other parts of the country, especially yung sa Palawan po.

asr-000766
00:52:51.790 --> 00:52:54.990
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Diba, papunta na po doon yung main facility.

asr-000767
00:52:54.990 --> 00:52:57.990
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Kamakailan po, binigyan po kami ni Governor Umali

asr-000768
00:52:58.560 --> 00:53:01.840
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: dito po sa Nueva Ecija

asr-000769
00:53:02.440 --> 00:53:12.650
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: ng 60 hectares. Doon po namin ililipat yung reception and diagnostic center.

asr-000770
00:53:13.030 --> 00:53:22.460
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: At yung po rin magiging mga tiga Metro Manila, north of Metro Manila, yung po ang aming target na magiging kulungan nila.

asr-000771
00:53:22.460 --> 00:53:26.340
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: And then south of Metro Manila, meron po kami tinitignan na property.

asr-000772
00:53:26.340 --> 00:53:30.510
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Magsaswapping po kami ng isang institusyon.

asr-000773
00:53:30.610 --> 00:53:37.600
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: May lupa raw sila sa Laguna ng mga 8,000 hectares na hindi naman nila masyadong ginagamit.

asr-000774
00:53:37.840 --> 00:53:44.880
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: And in exchange, bibigyan po namin sila ng 500 hectares sa Palawan para itayo yung kanilang eskwelahan sa Palawan.

asr-000775
00:53:45.460 --> 00:53:53.330
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: So, pag nangyari po yun, lahat ng tiga Luzon ay hindi na maililipat sa outside Luzon.

asr-000776
00:53:53.330 --> 00:53:55.570
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Yung mga tiga Luzon, sa Luzon ang makakukulong.

asr-000777
00:53:55.570 --> 00:54:04.460
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: And then lately rin po, yung nakita rin namin na mas marami pa lang tiga Cebu ang mga nakukulong sa Bisaya.

asr-000778
00:54:04.680 --> 00:54:12.590
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: So, we are also coordinating with the governor, the good governor, na bigyan din po kami ng kulungan doon sa lugar

asr-000779
00:54:12.590 --> 00:54:19.800
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: para yung tuloy-tuloy po natin magiging regionalization yung ating mga PDL.

asr-000780
00:54:20.340 --> 00:54:20.860
BuCor Director General Gregorio Pio P. Catapang Jr.: Salamat po.

asr-000781
00:54:21.090 --> 00:54:22.990
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Maraming salamat po, DG Katapang.

asr-000782
00:54:22.990 --> 00:54:23.590
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Mr. Chair.

asr-000783
00:54:23.590 --> 00:54:33.010
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Napansin ko po doon sa report kanina ng ating department, mostly yung kanilang performance indicators,

asr-000784
00:54:33.390 --> 00:54:39.380
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: but wala po dito yung utilization po ng budget from last year.

asr-000785
00:54:40.100 --> 00:54:52.490
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: So, maybe we can request our department or the DOJ to provide committee the utilization po ng budget.

asr-000786
00:54:53.650 --> 00:54:55.030
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: As of today po.

asr-000787
00:54:56.660 --> 00:55:01.930
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: If it is available, please furnish Representative Padernos and a copy to the committee.

asr-000788
00:55:02.080 --> 00:55:03.980
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yes, we will furnish, Your Honor.

asr-000789
00:55:04.880 --> 00:55:07.620
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Your Honor, if I may add lang, doon sa decongestion.

asr-000790
00:55:08.470 --> 00:55:10.350
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Dalwa ho to, lutong bibingka.

asr-000791
00:55:10.950 --> 00:55:14.310
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ang isa ho yung nagdadagdag tayo ng facilities, no?

asr-000792
00:55:14.850 --> 00:55:18.870
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Basically, ang isa pa rin ho, pinabibilis din natin yung release natin.

asr-000793
00:55:18.870 --> 00:55:23.460
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Na nagawa na po natin ng medyo maganda na po ang proseso natin.

asr-000794
00:55:23.480 --> 00:55:26.480
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Lalo na po yung mga may GCTA nating mga...

asr-000795
00:55:27.420 --> 00:55:30.870
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Alam naman po natin yung mga kababayan na natin na naligaw ng landas.

asr-000796
00:55:31.370 --> 00:55:34.390
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Pero lahat naman po may opportunity ng second chance.

asr-000797
00:55:34.590 --> 00:55:40.370
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Pag naka-comply na ho sila doon sa requirements ng batas, mag-comply sila sa GCTA,

asr-000798
00:55:40.990 --> 00:55:45.980
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: buong yabang din ho namin pinagmamalaki na ang BUCOR po,

asr-000799
00:55:46.340 --> 00:55:50.440
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: kakibat ang PAO, kakibat po yung ating PPA,

asr-000800
00:55:51.280 --> 00:55:52.920
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: nakapagpa-release na ho tayo ng...

asr-000801
00:55:52.920 --> 00:56:00.390
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: From 2022, 32,932 PDLs.

asr-000802
00:56:00.730 --> 00:56:03.990
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So kasama po nito, mas mabilis na po natin na pro-proseso.

asr-000803
00:56:05.560 --> 00:56:07.920
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Gumamit na rin po tayo dito ng teknolohiya, no?

asr-000804
00:56:08.380 --> 00:56:12.700
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So ngayon yung mga karpeta, wala na ho yung pagala-gala o nawawalang karpeta.

asr-000805
00:56:13.360 --> 00:56:17.250
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ngayon ho sa BUCOR, lahat po, bago pa lang sila pumasok,

asr-000806
00:56:17.250 --> 00:56:20.950
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: naka-digitize na ho. May redundancy plan na ho tayo

asr-000807
00:56:20.950 --> 00:56:22.810
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: na hindi mawawala yung karpeta.

asr-000808
00:56:22.950 --> 00:56:26.790
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kaya po, mas na-anticipate na natin.

asr-000809
00:56:26.990 --> 00:56:31.000
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: At tumataas din yung pag-asa ng ating mga kapatid na nakakulong

asr-000810
00:56:31.000 --> 00:56:35.760
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: na pag ako'y nagbait dito sa loob, makakalaya na ako sa ganitong panahon.

asr-000811
00:56:36.500 --> 00:56:41.170
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So, ano ho, dalawang inisyatibo ho,

asr-000812
00:56:41.570 --> 00:56:44.450
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: padamihin yung regional prisons facility natin

asr-000813
00:56:44.450 --> 00:56:49.030
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: at ang isa, pabilisin din yung releases natin dun sa qualified na po.

asr-000814
00:56:49.570 --> 00:56:52.960
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kasi po, ang ayaw po natin ay yung nakakulong,

asr-000815
00:56:52.980 --> 00:56:55.360
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: nakakakuha lang ng abogado ang nare-release.

asr-000816
00:56:55.940 --> 00:56:59.360
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Dahil sila lang yung nakakapag-file ng writ of habeas corpus.

asr-000817
00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:02.790
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kaya po, sa ngayon ho, updated po yung ating releases.

asr-000818
00:57:04.150 --> 00:57:08.570
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ang target po ng DOJ diyan ay not a day longer.

asr-000819
00:57:09.230 --> 00:57:13.310
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Not a day longer if, of course, it's not a perfect system.

asr-000820
00:57:13.450 --> 00:57:16.420
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We're working on it, we're striving hard para po,

asr-000821
00:57:16.500 --> 00:57:19.500
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: not a day longer yung ating pong mga kapatid na PDLs.

asr-000822
00:57:19.660 --> 00:57:22.540
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ito po ang dahilan kaya 180% po.

asr-000823
00:57:23.000 --> 00:57:26.490
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: As of this time po, pero we're working hard para po

asr-000824
00:57:26.490 --> 00:57:30.670
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: makamit natin yung ideal number po para sa ating mga nakakulong.

asr-000825
00:57:31.690 --> 00:57:33.070
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000826
00:57:34.270 --> 00:57:38.600
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: For my next question is on, with regard to the ano po,

asr-000827
00:57:38.760 --> 00:57:45.570
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: I'd also like to request from the DOJ yung ating vacancies in every department,

asr-000828
00:57:45.770 --> 00:57:47.830
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: every agencies, attached agencies,

asr-000829
00:57:47.830 --> 00:57:52.620
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: para po malaman natin saan po ba kailangan na lagyan ng,

asr-000830
00:57:53.300 --> 00:57:55.470
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: ano po yung mga open for applications.

asr-000831
00:57:55.690 --> 00:57:57.330
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Kasi may plantilya na po yung mga yan,

asr-000832
00:57:57.690 --> 00:58:01.050
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: sayang naman po kung hindi ma-fill up yung ating vacancies.

asr-000833
00:58:01.590 --> 00:58:05.020
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Mayroon po ba tayong brief report on our vacancies?

asr-000834
00:58:13.060 --> 00:58:15.060
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We will submit a comprehensive report,

asr-000835
00:58:15.220 --> 00:58:16.940
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: but as a summary, Your Honor,

asr-000836
00:58:17.660 --> 00:58:23.360
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: out of the 7,651 authorized plantilya positions

asr-000837
00:58:23.360 --> 00:58:26.500
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: for the Office of the Secretary, that's the Department of Justice,

asr-000838
00:58:27.440 --> 00:58:30.360
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: we have 6,145 filled up.

asr-000839
00:58:30.480 --> 00:58:34.900
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And 1,506 unfilled positions.

asr-000840
00:58:35.860 --> 00:58:43.070
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So, and we would also be happy to report to you na,

asr-000841
00:58:43.450 --> 00:58:45.490
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: nung nag-start po ng administration na to,

asr-000842
00:58:45.590 --> 00:58:47.930
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: especially po yung mga presidential appointees,

asr-000843
00:58:48.370 --> 00:58:52.750
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: we started with a timeline na almost 2 years, yung mga piskal po natin.

asr-000844
00:58:53.190 --> 00:58:56.810
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Now, with cooperation with DBM and the Office of the President,

asr-000845
00:58:56.810 --> 00:59:00.430
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: na-shorten na po natin to 4 to 5 months po,

asr-000846
00:59:00.490 --> 00:59:03.510
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: yung mga piskal po natin, yung mga prosecutor positions.

asr-000847
00:59:04.050 --> 00:59:06.630
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And we're also happy to report to this committee

asr-000848
00:59:06.630 --> 00:59:09.990
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: that since the start of this administration,

asr-000849
00:59:10.530 --> 00:59:14.370
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: from 2,966 prosecutorial position,

asr-000850
00:59:15.210 --> 00:59:19.290
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: the DBM has created additional 1,002.

asr-000851
00:59:19.430 --> 00:59:24.360
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So, we're now 3,968 prosecutorial positions.

asr-000852
00:59:25.080 --> 00:59:27.660
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And ang take-up po nito sa public, maganda po.

asr-000853
00:59:27.660 --> 00:59:30.360
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Meron po kaming mga posisyon, mga Your Honors,

asr-000854
00:59:30.500 --> 00:59:33.260
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: isang posisyon, 103 applicants.

asr-000855
00:59:33.260 --> 00:59:38.700
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So, we're able to recruit, hopefully, the best and the brightest

asr-000856
00:59:38.700 --> 00:59:44.300
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: from those in the legal sector so that they join the workforce po

asr-000857
00:59:44.300 --> 00:59:46.440
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: ng ating National Prosecution Service.

asr-000858
00:59:47.560 --> 00:59:48.760
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000859
00:59:49.720 --> 00:59:55.030
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Gusto ko lang din pong i-discuss yung ating mga petition for review under the DOJ

asr-000860
00:59:55.030 --> 00:59:57.480
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: kasi based on my experience,

asr-000861
00:59:57.540 --> 01:00:07.360
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: my experience even before when I was practicing, dun po talaga nagkakaroon ng parang patong-patong

asr-000862
01:00:07.360 --> 01:00:14.480
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: na kaso. Ano na po bang status doon and paano po na-address ngayon ng ating bagong

asr-000863
01:00:14.480 --> 01:00:16.950
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: kalihim itong problema na to po?

asr-000864
01:00:18.660 --> 01:00:30.590
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Of course, when I assumed as acting secretary November 11, sometime in this year po, early

asr-000865
01:00:30.590 --> 01:00:37.620
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: this year, I issued a department circular. Pag nakita ninyo po yung docket namin, total po iyan ng

asr-000866
01:00:37.620 --> 01:00:44.530
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: 27,000 sa Office of the Secretary, petitions for review, starting as old as panahon pa po

asr-000867
01:00:44.530 --> 01:00:46.080
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: ni Secretary Raul Gonzalez.

asr-000868
01:00:47.130 --> 01:00:48.430
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So what happens?

asr-000869
01:00:48.450 --> 01:00:56.310
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: What I did, I issued the department circular. So commencing po November 12, 2025, all petitions

asr-000870
01:00:56.310 --> 01:01:02.030
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: for review filed starting November 12, I have delegated, I've given authority to all the

asr-000871
01:01:02.030 --> 01:01:09.120
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: undersecretaries to review them and to ensure na 100% ang clearance rate. Ang nakikita po

asr-000872
01:01:09.120 --> 01:01:15.490
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: namin, Your Honors, around 200 per week po yung nagpe-petition for review. So around 800

asr-000873
01:01:15.490 --> 01:01:17.480
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: per month. With eight undersecretaries.

asr-000874
01:01:18.230 --> 01:01:25.800
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ang mandate ko po sa kanila is hopefully we clear everything that goes in starting November

asr-000875
01:01:25.800 --> 01:01:31.570
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: 11. Naka-delegate na po sa undersecretaries. Ano naman po ang gagawin ni Secretary ng department

asr-000876
01:01:31.570 --> 01:01:39.910
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: for those pending November 11 and prior years. So nag-cut off po kami ng January 1, 2022-November 11, 2025.

asr-000877
01:01:40.350 --> 01:01:47.200
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: November 11, 2025. Yan po yung nasa opisina ko and I have certain task forces helping me

asr-000878
01:01:47.200 --> 01:01:47.500
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: out.

asr-000879
01:01:48.020 --> 01:01:53.870
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: On that, para po ma-resolve siya, ma-resolve siya, different reviewing legal teams po.

asr-000880
01:01:54.510 --> 01:02:04.990
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And so far po, from those pending from 2020 to 2025, that's around 16,000. That's around

asr-000881
01:02:04.990 --> 01:02:13.070
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: 16,000 po cases. My office has resolved almost 500 na po thus far. But we continue the work.

asr-000882
01:02:13.070 --> 01:02:14.130
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We continue the work.

asr-000883
01:02:15.340 --> 01:02:17.680
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: For the older ones, yung prior to 2020.

asr-000884
01:02:17.800 --> 01:02:26.800
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We also have a... We also issued publications to litigants who are parties to those petitions

asr-000885
01:02:26.800 --> 01:02:34.100
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: for review and we've asked them, basically, to confirm or not to confirm yung interest

asr-000886
01:02:34.100 --> 01:02:41.910
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: sila on those cases yet. And hopefully, by end of this quarter, Your Honors, no? And

asr-000887
01:02:41.910 --> 01:02:46.080
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: we will gladly share with the committee how we are moving forward with all these cases.

asr-000889
01:02:47.050 --> 01:02:54.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: This is basically po, ang tawag nga po sa mga practitioner dyan, pag pumasok daw sa DOJ, parang black hole.

asr-000890
01:02:55.130 --> 01:02:58.110
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Hindi na alam kung ano yung nangyari ng petition for review.

asr-000891
01:02:58.110 --> 01:03:04.300
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: But we're trying to address this because this is a check and balance mechanism sa mga field offices po natin.

asr-000892
01:03:04.860 --> 01:03:08.040
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: For everyone's information, we have 250 offices nationwide.

asr-000893
01:03:09.330 --> 01:03:15.640
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ito po yung city prosecutor's office, provincial prosecutor's office, regional prosecutor's office.

asr-000894
01:03:15.640 --> 01:03:21.440
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And also the office of the Secretary of Justice Prosecutorial Service, which is in Padre Faura.

asr-000895
01:03:21.960 --> 01:03:26.560
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Of all this, the litigant has a remedy going to the Secretary of Justice.

asr-000896
01:03:26.560 --> 01:03:32.240
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And we're trying to put up a system here so that we resolve them in time.

asr-000897
01:03:33.100 --> 01:03:38.160
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: The problem po is, based on time and motion, talaga pong may challenge ang Department of Justice.

asr-000898
01:03:38.740 --> 01:03:43.180
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: But we cannot naman prohibit filing of these petitions for review.

asr-000899
01:03:43.900 --> 01:03:45.430
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So it's basically...

asr-000900
01:03:45.430 --> 01:03:52.790
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: It's basically driven din po from the litigants po na nagpa-file ng petitions sa amin.

asr-000901
01:03:52.870 --> 01:03:56.630
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: But I think, Your Honor, we're in the right direction.

asr-000902
01:03:57.040 --> 01:04:02.290
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Hopefully, we improve as the months, as the days go by.

asr-000903
01:04:02.720 --> 01:04:03.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Your Honor.

asr-000904
01:04:03.750 --> 01:04:04.980
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000905
01:04:06.820 --> 01:04:12.710
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Pasadaan ko lang po sa ating Bureau of Immigration naman on the status of our e-gates and modernization.

asr-000906
01:04:13.270 --> 01:04:14.700
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Ilang e-gates na po bang...

asr-000907
01:04:15.180 --> 01:04:20.840
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Ang fully operational ngayon sa Naia, Clark, Mactan, Cebu, at Davao.

asr-000908
01:04:21.310 --> 01:04:27.510
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Anong procurement status po nung natitirang units for Phase 1, 1.976 billion,

asr-000909
01:04:27.510 --> 01:04:30.810
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: at Phase 2, 1.347 billion?

asr-000910
01:04:31.490 --> 01:04:37.320
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: May service level agreement po standards ba tayo sa IT providers natin pag nagka-downtime?

asr-000911
01:04:38.000 --> 01:04:42.920
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: At nakasingil na po ba tayo ng penalties laban sa mga kontraktor?

asr-000912
01:04:42.920 --> 01:04:43.300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, sir.

asr-000913
01:04:43.600 --> 01:04:44.370
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Magandang hapon po.

asr-000914
01:04:44.570 --> 01:04:49.310
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Mr. Chairman and Congressman Padernos and Honorable Members of the House of Representatives.

asr-000915
01:04:50.150 --> 01:04:53.490
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdating po sa e-gates po natin, sa Terminal 1 po,

asr-000916
01:04:54.190 --> 01:05:01.450
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang total po currently is 18, 12 para sa arrival, at for departure, 6 na e-gates po.

asr-000917
01:05:01.930 --> 01:05:07.040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Para naman po sa T3, ang arrival po, meron pong tatlumpu, or 30.

asr-000918
01:05:07.480 --> 01:05:09.910
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa departure po, tatlumpu rin po, or 30.

asr-000919
01:05:10.390 --> 01:05:14.410
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So ang total po sa Terminals 1 and 3 is 78.

asr-000920
01:05:14.710 --> 01:05:23.520
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdating naman po sa Cebu International—Clark, I'm sorry po—Clark International Airport, meron pong tatlo.

asr-000921
01:05:24.720 --> 01:05:27.390
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Dito naman po sa Mactan Cebu, tatlong rin po.

asr-000922
01:05:27.720 --> 01:05:30.410
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa Davao International Airport, dalawa po.

asr-000923
01:05:31.490 --> 01:05:42.390
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So yun po ang total number po ng e-gates po natin, not only sa T1 and T3, but sa ibang international airports po, sa labas po ng Metro Manila.

asr-000924
01:05:42.390 --> 01:05:44.400
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ngayon, pagdating naman po sa...

asr-000925
01:05:44.860 --> 01:05:48.480
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: status po nung ating e-gates project,

asr-000926
01:05:51.120 --> 01:05:57.730
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: yun pong sa Phase 1, na awarded po nung 2025, 1.5 billion po yun.

asr-000927
01:05:58.330 --> 01:06:01.170
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Continuing po ang aming procurement, Your Honor.

asr-000928
01:06:01.570 --> 01:06:05.430
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nakatipid po tayo doon sa intended budget na 1.9 billion, ng 400 million.

asr-000929
01:06:06.210 --> 01:06:09.070
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdating naman po sa Phase 2 po ng proyekto,

asr-000930
01:06:09.890 --> 01:06:14.610
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang terms of reference po para dito sa Phase 2 ng proyekto, worth 1.3 billion,

asr-000931
01:06:15.320 --> 01:06:16.480
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: underway na po sa Departamento.

asr-000932
01:06:16.800 --> 01:06:21.590
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The Department of Justice, yung pong listahan po ng mga terms of reference.

asr-000933
01:06:22.130 --> 01:06:25.460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdating naman po sa Phase 3, 565 million po yun.

asr-000934
01:06:26.090 --> 01:06:32.920
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang commitment po namin, at we're on track, na on budget po for 2025, meron po kaming catch-up plan,

asr-000935
01:06:33.100 --> 01:06:36.200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: magiging fully obligated na po by November 2026.

asr-000936
01:06:36.640 --> 01:06:40.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kasama na po dyan yung sa e-gates Phase 1 project.

asr-000937
01:06:40.480 --> 01:06:46.930
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: At ang Phase 2 po ng e-gates project, worth 1.3 billion, magiging fully obligated na rin po by November.

asr-000938
01:06:46.950 --> 01:06:52.210
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: As a matter of fact, Your Honor, we have been conducting weekly meetings

asr-000939
01:06:52.210 --> 01:06:58.990
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: para po malaman ng ahensya kung ano na po ang status ng ating proyekto.

asr-000940
01:06:59.850 --> 01:07:03.570
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdating naman po, Your Honor, sa service agreements, meron po tayong service agreements,

asr-000941
01:07:03.690 --> 01:07:05.280
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: but those are constantly under review.

asr-000942
01:07:05.840 --> 01:07:20.670
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kasama po sa service agreements, hinihingi po namin ng commitment sa mapuprovide po dito ng mga kumpanya, Your Honors.

asr-000943
01:07:24.900 --> 01:07:27.730
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Follow-up question lang po.

asr-000944
01:07:28.900 --> 01:07:31.770
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: So okay na po lahat. So kailan po matatapos yung Phase 2?

asr-000945
01:07:32.340 --> 01:07:38.350
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang Phase 2 po, matatapos po by November 2026. Fully obligated na po yan by that time.

asr-000946
01:07:38.760 --> 01:07:43.070
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: So I'd just like to commend, Mr. Chair, yung efforts po ng ating Bureau of Immigration.

asr-000947
01:07:43.840 --> 01:07:50.060
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: If you notice, ating mga kababayan, mas mabilis na ngayon yung proseso pag nasa airport.

asr-000948
01:07:50.060 --> 01:07:53.050
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Of course, with their partnership also with...

asr-000949
01:07:54.470 --> 01:07:55.660
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Airport operator.

asr-000950
01:07:56.300 --> 01:08:00.940
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Sa ano naman po ako, sa PCGG po. Saan po ba ang PCGG?

asr-000951
01:08:03.280 --> 01:08:04.430
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Nandiyan po ba ang PCGG?

asr-000953
01:08:05.010 --> 01:08:05.230
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Ayan.

asr-000954
01:08:05.230 --> 01:08:05.400
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Justice.

asr-000955
01:08:06.090 --> 01:08:06.670
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Justice po.

asr-000956
01:08:06.670 --> 01:08:13.790
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Mr. Chair, gusto ko lang po sanang itanong. What is the current budget vis-a-vis total remittance of PCGG?

asr-000957
01:08:13.790 --> 01:08:16.990
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: And with that contribution, they have a specific...

asr-000958
01:08:17.800 --> 01:08:25.650
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Does PCGG have a specific proposal which will not entail additional funding from Congress?

asr-000959
01:08:28.060 --> 01:08:36.800
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Mr. Chair, members of the committee, thank you for this opportunity.

asr-000960
01:08:36.800 --> 01:08:54.290
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Just for historical context, your honors, in the past 40 years, the PCGG has recovered a total amount of 183 billion in cash,

asr-000961
01:08:54.290 --> 01:08:57.210
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: 125 billion in assets.

asr-000962
01:08:57.270 --> 01:09:09.080
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: And as of now, during the current administration, the PCGG was able to recover

asr-000963
01:09:09.080 --> 01:09:20.770
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: 8.3 billion worth of assets. As far as budget is concerned, historically, the budget of

asr-000964
01:09:20.770 --> 01:09:28.520
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: the PCGG has always been below 200 million. So, given that we have already, that it has

asr-000965
01:09:28.520 --> 01:09:38.410
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: remitted 8.3 billion during the current administration, I would say that the budget of PCGG was really

asr-000966
01:09:38.410 --> 01:09:43.410
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: given us good returns.

asr-000967
01:09:48.200 --> 01:09:51.600
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Maraming salamat po. Meron pa po kayong maidadagdag?

asr-000968
01:09:52.740 --> 01:09:58.890
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: The additional funding from Congress.

asr-000969
01:09:59.110 --> 01:09:59.490
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Ano po iyon?

asr-000970
01:10:00.320 --> 01:10:13.630
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: We have a bigger budget now, Your Honors, because PCGG will start paying rent for office

asr-000971
01:10:13.630 --> 01:10:21.680
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: space. Because before, our office space was free. As one of the conditions, when we sold

asr-000972
01:10:21.680 --> 01:10:28.270
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: an asset, which is in front of Mega Mall along EDSA, we sold that for 800 million pesos.

asr-000973
01:10:28.270 --> 01:10:35.670
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: And the buyer was San Miguel. And they have a building, which we are now occupying, and

asr-000974
01:10:35.670 --> 01:10:39.450
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: they gave us a part of the building for occupation.

asr-000976
01:10:40.160 --> 01:10:47.160
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Quick manifestation na lang, Mr. Chair. So, base naman po sa report

asr-000977
01:10:47.160 --> 01:10:54.280
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: ng ating DOJ, res ipsa loquitur. The numbers speak for themselves. Case disposition rate

asr-000978
01:10:54.280 --> 01:10:56.330
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: po, napakataas, 99%.

asr-000979
01:10:56.490 --> 01:11:05.210
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Ang success rate nila ng prosecution, also 90 plus percent. And lahat po ng ating mga

asr-000980
01:11:05.210 --> 01:11:14.480
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: performance indicators, it would appear na the DOJ is really doing their job and exceeding

asr-000981
01:11:14.480 --> 01:11:22.710
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: our expectation. So, with that said, I would like to manifest my full support for the proposed

asr-000982
01:11:22.710 --> 01:11:26.320
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: budget. Actually, edit po natin yan.

asr-000983
01:11:27.270 --> 01:11:33.650
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: I manifest that not just my full support for the proposed budget of the Department of

asr-000984
01:11:33.650 --> 01:11:40.520
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Justice, but also the increase of its budget, especially for the NBI and BI, kasi nakita ko

asr-000985
01:11:40.520 --> 01:11:48.480
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: po ang NBI at BI, 33 percent and 27 percent decrease. Meron po ba tayong brief lang na

asr-000986
01:11:48.480 --> 01:11:56.050
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: explanation kung bakit po nabawasan ng sobrang taas yung dalawang agencies na yan? But with

asr-000987
01:11:56.050 --> 01:11:58.020
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: that said, yun lang po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000988
01:11:59.660 --> 01:12:08.910
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: I believe this would be relative to the absorptive capacity ng agency. This was, of course, this

asr-000989
01:12:08.910 --> 01:12:13.570
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: is the DBM's call, no? But it was assessed by the DBM yung absorptive capacity of the

asr-000990
01:12:13.570 --> 01:12:19.320
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: two agencies. That's why we have catch-up plans for 2026, so that they are able to cope

asr-000991
01:12:19.320 --> 01:12:24.300
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: with the budget releases for the two respective agencies. But thank you very much, Your Honor,

asr-000992
01:12:24.720 --> 01:12:25.310
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: for the support.

asr-000993
01:12:25.530 --> 01:12:26.310
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000994
01:12:26.510 --> 01:12:33.550
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you, Representative Padernos. And may we direct the ComSec to acknowledge additional

asr-000995
01:12:33.550 --> 01:12:35.960
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: members who are present?

asr-000996
01:12:37.160 --> 01:12:45.580
Committee Secretary: Additional members present: Representative Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr., Representative Alyssa Michaela "Mica" Gonzales,

asr-000997
01:12:45.580 --> 01:12:52.030
Committee Secretary: Representative Robert Nazal, Representative Ma. Cristina Talavera-Lopez, Representative Salvador

asr-000998
01:12:52.030 --> 01:12:55.830
Committee Secretary: Pleyto, Representative Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai,

asr-000999
01:12:55.830 --> 01:12:56.860
Committee Secretary: Representative Ferdinand Hernandez.

asr-001000
01:12:56.860 --> 01:12:59.940
Committee Secretary: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001001
01:13:00.580 --> 01:13:06.770
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you. Next in line to interpellate from the minority, Representative Chel Diokno.

asr-001002
01:13:08.380 --> 01:13:14.180
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Maraming salamat po, Chair Mike, at magandang hapon po sa DOJ family.

asr-001003
01:13:14.200 --> 01:13:20.820
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Sisimulan ko po sa isang letter C. Hindi po ito Chel, kundi corruption ang dapat nating

asr-001004
01:13:20.840 --> 01:13:22.220
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: pag-usapan.

asr-001005
01:13:22.240 --> 01:13:27.380
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: I noticed that there was a recent article attributed to the DOJ.

asr-001006
01:13:27.400 --> 01:13:32.780
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: which stated that the over 841 million pesos

asr-001007
01:13:32.800 --> 01:13:39.140
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ay naibalik na sa ating treasury from flood control projects.

asr-001008
01:13:39.160 --> 01:13:45.500
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Mula sa apat na nasangkot sa flood control cases na naging state witness,

asr-001009
01:13:45.520 --> 01:13:52.420
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: I think this would refer to Henry Alcantara, former USEC Bernardo, 500 million,

asr-001010
01:13:52.440 --> 01:14:02.380
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Henry Alcantara, 181 million, Engineer Opulencia, 140 million, and Sally Santos, 20 million.

asr-001011
01:14:02.400 --> 01:14:06.620
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Una ko pong tanong kay Secretary Vida, good morning po.

asr-001012
01:14:06.640 --> 01:14:09.290
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Voluntary po itong pagbabalik nila?

asr-001013
01:14:09.310 --> 01:14:11.080
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Opo, voluntary po ito.

asr-001014
01:14:11.100 --> 01:14:16.900
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Meron bang na-file na mga forfeiture cases against any of these four individuals

asr-001015
01:14:16.920 --> 01:14:21.860
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: to ensure na baka naman meron pa silang tinatago na hindi pa nila binibigay

asr-001016
01:14:21.880 --> 01:14:24.550
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: o binabalik sa gobyerno?

asr-001017
01:14:24.570 --> 01:14:30.860
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Actually, kaakibat po ito sa kondisyon nung kanilang pagpasok bilang state witness, Your Honor.

asr-001018
01:14:30.880 --> 01:14:35.100
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: At sa ngayon nga po, nagagamit sila ngayon ng Office of the Ombudsman

asr-001019
01:14:35.120 --> 01:14:42.260
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: sa patuloy na paglilitis ng mga kasong nakasalang ngayon sa Sandiganbayan at sa RTC.

asr-001020
01:14:42.280 --> 01:14:47.660
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kaya po ang patuloy nilang pagganap dun sa terms and conditions

asr-001021
01:14:47.680 --> 01:14:51.500
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: ng kanilang pagiging state witness, ito po ang kabahagi nun.

asr-001022
01:14:51.520 --> 01:14:52.340
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Your Honor.

asr-001023
01:14:52.360 --> 01:14:55.820
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Did you rely just on their word, or did you also

asr-001024
01:14:55.840 --> 01:15:02.540
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: coordinate with AMLA, get bank secrecy waivers, and do other checking

asr-001025
01:15:02.560 --> 01:15:08.220
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: para masiguro natin na lahat ng sinasabi nilang ibinalik ay yun na po yun?

asr-001026
01:15:08.240 --> 01:15:14.820
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ang naging estratehiya po niyan para makita po yung mga commitment nilang amounts,

asr-001027
01:15:14.840 --> 01:15:22.660
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: tandaan po natin, paalala lang po pala, yung pagiging state witness nila ay case-specific lang ho.

asr-001028
01:15:22.680 --> 01:15:25.940
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kaya yung kanilang immunity, dun sa kasong yun lang ho.

asr-001029
01:15:25.960 --> 01:15:33.340
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kaya yung may disclosure sila na sila kesyo ay may kinita dun sa project na yun,

asr-001030
01:15:33.360 --> 01:15:35.340
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: yun lamang po sila absuwelto.

asr-001031
01:15:35.360 --> 01:15:41.580
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kaya po pag may nadiskubre ang Office of the Ombudsman, ang DOJ, o kung ano mang ahensya,

asr-001032
01:15:41.600 --> 01:15:45.740
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: na ibang bagay na sila'y sangkot pa rin, hindi ho yun saklaw.

asr-001033
01:15:45.760 --> 01:15:50.420
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kaya po ang atin po, tinakda po natin yung pagtatalaga nung amount na to,

asr-001034
01:15:50.440 --> 01:15:55.500
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: nagsimula pa po ito panahon ni Secretary, now Ombudsman, Boying Remulla,

asr-001035
01:15:55.520 --> 01:15:58.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: na project-specific lang.

asr-001036
01:15:58.160 --> 01:16:03.460
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yung sinabi nyo lang na kayo ay sangkot at kayo ay involved,

asr-001037
01:16:03.480 --> 01:16:07.020
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: pero yung immunity mo, dun lang sa particular na project na yun.

asr-001038
01:16:07.040 --> 01:16:11.420
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kaya pag may nakita po tayo, tingin ko ho, protektado ang bayan dito.

asr-001039
01:16:11.440 --> 01:16:15.260
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Pag may nakita ho tayo sa apat na to, sa kanilang apat na individual,

asr-001040
01:16:15.280 --> 01:16:20.100
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: na walang disclosure o may tinago sa atin, pwede pa ho natin silang habulin dun.

asr-001041
01:16:20.120 --> 01:16:23.940
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Of course, iba po yung sa pananaw ng Office of the Ombudsman.

asr-001042
01:16:23.960 --> 01:16:25.620
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Iba pong usapin.

asr-001043
01:16:25.640 --> 01:16:29.640
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Sa amin po, yung pagiging state witness sila under the Witness Protection Program.

asr-001044
01:16:29.660 --> 01:16:31.820
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you, Secretary Vida.

asr-001045
01:16:31.840 --> 01:16:38.140
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Doon sa very impressive yung inyong report, lalong-lalo na yung tinatawag ninyong

asr-001046
01:16:38.160 --> 01:16:40.700
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: prosecutorial success rate, or PSR,

asr-001047
01:16:40.720 --> 01:16:46.100
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: na ngayon na taon na ito, o 2025, ay nasa 90.8%.

asr-001048
01:16:46.120 --> 01:16:54.620
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Do you have a figure for your PSR for graft and corruption cases?

asr-001049
01:16:54.640 --> 01:16:55.300
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Kasi yun na yun po

asr-001050
01:16:55.320 --> 01:16:57.620
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ang tinututukan ng taong bayan ngayon.

asr-001051
01:16:57.640 --> 01:17:01.860
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Gusto naming malaman kung yung mga graft and corruption cases ba

asr-001052
01:17:01.880 --> 01:17:06.220
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: nabibigyan ng top priority ng ating pamahalaan.

asr-001053
01:17:06.240 --> 01:17:11.440
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Karamihan ba ng mga nasasangkot ay nakakasuhan at nako-convict?

asr-001054
01:17:11.460 --> 01:17:18.340
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Opo, opo, Your Honor. We need to disaggregate our data, yung available po sa amin.

asr-001055
01:17:18.360 --> 01:17:23.380
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And we will submit to the committee, Your Honors, if you may.

asr-001056
01:17:23.400 --> 01:17:25.940
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We need to disaggregate yung data namin.

asr-001057
01:17:25.960 --> 01:17:30.900
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And of course, this data doesn't involve cases handled by the Office of the Ombudsman.

asr-001058
01:17:30.920 --> 01:17:31.780
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Yes.

asr-001059
01:17:31.800 --> 01:17:34.580
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: In fact, I'll go back to that point later.

asr-001060
01:17:34.600 --> 01:17:41.140
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: But I'm just curious, because in 2022, when Secretary, now Ombudsman, Remulla

asr-001061
01:17:41.160 --> 01:17:44.300
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: occupied the Office of Secretary of Justice,

asr-001062
01:17:44.320 --> 01:17:49.420
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: nabanggit niya na ang conviction rate, hindi po ito PSR, kundi conviction rate,

asr-001063
01:17:49.440 --> 01:17:51.380
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ay nasa 25% lang.

asr-001064
01:17:51.400 --> 01:17:54.620
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: In fact, he expressed dismay over it.

asr-001065
01:17:54.640 --> 01:17:55.340
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Now,

asr-001066
01:17:55.360 --> 01:17:58.500
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: your figure of 90% is very impressive,

asr-001067
01:17:58.520 --> 01:18:04.220
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: but it may give the wrong impression to the public

asr-001068
01:18:04.240 --> 01:18:08.540
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: that we have already overcome our issues with convictions.

asr-001069
01:18:08.560 --> 01:18:15.500
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: So, may I know, does the DOJ keep a separate tab on conviction rate aside from PSR?

asr-001070
01:18:15.520 --> 01:18:20.580
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: O na-abandonan po ninyo yan?

asr-001071
01:18:20.600 --> 01:18:22.860
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Actually, hindi po namin.

asr-001072
01:18:22.880 --> 01:18:26.740
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: The prosecution success rate, mix po ito.

asr-001073
01:18:26.760 --> 01:18:35.060
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yung conviction ng kaso, kasama na rin po dito yung tinatawag po na nagkaroon po ng compromise agreement.

asr-001074
01:18:35.080 --> 01:18:42.420
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And based on that compromise, nagkaroon pa rin ng hatol yung husgado sa isang particular na kaso.

asr-001075
01:18:42.440 --> 01:18:44.060
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ito po yung pumapasok.

asr-001076
01:18:44.080 --> 01:18:51.260
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Pero batid po namin, yung 20%, if I recall it right, that would be more particular po.

asr-001077
01:18:51.280 --> 01:18:57.060
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yung frustration po ni Secretary Boying at the time was more in the drug cases.

asr-001078
01:18:57.080 --> 01:19:11.900
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yung after po, yung after nung 2022, na lumabas na po yung mga tunay na proseso na kahit fiscal ka o judge ka,

asr-001079
01:19:11.920 --> 01:19:19.500
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: na nag-dismiss ka ng kaso base sa ebidensya, hindi ka li-labelan na protector ng droga.

asr-001080
01:19:19.520 --> 01:19:24.940
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Tapos, ang isa pa rin ho, ito po yung pagtataas namin nung antas, yung from probable cause,

asr-001081
01:19:24.960 --> 01:19:29.900
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: tinaas po ng DOJ, yung antas po ng ebidensya na kailangan natin ngayon,

asr-001082
01:19:29.920 --> 01:19:35.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: yung prima facie evidence with reasonable certainty of conviction.

asr-001083
01:19:35.160 --> 01:19:45.020
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ang isa pong nakikita naming ehemplo dito ay yung sa, pag nakita po natin yung mga sa United States po,

asr-001084
01:19:45.040 --> 01:19:47.900
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: ang taas po ng kanilang plea bargaining.

asr-001085
01:19:47.920 --> 01:19:54.700
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Dahil pag plea bargaining, mas mabilis po ang proseso, mas maliit ang resources ng gobyerno.

asr-001086
01:19:54.720 --> 01:19:57.540
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So, dahil matitibay yung kasong fina-file.

asr-001087
01:19:57.560 --> 01:20:05.120
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And we see ho the benefit now of our case buildup, Your Honors, with the data we're getting.

asr-001088
01:20:05.140 --> 01:20:12.340
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Tama po ba, Secretary Vida, na pagdating sa prosecutorial success rate,

asr-001089
01:20:12.360 --> 01:20:16.820
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: hindi po kasama doon sa computation yung mga nadi-dismiss na kaso

asr-001090
01:20:16.840 --> 01:20:21.220
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: dahil let's say, hindi dumating yung mga testigo, let's say drug case,

asr-001091
01:20:21.240 --> 01:20:24.300
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: yung mga pulis na dapat humarap ay hindi humarap,

asr-001092
01:20:24.320 --> 01:20:27.820
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: kaya nadismiss na agad ang kaso.

asr-001093
01:20:27.840 --> 01:20:29.810
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Is that captured by the PSR?

asr-001094
01:20:45.920 --> 01:20:46.730
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Is that captured?

asr-001095
01:20:48.220 --> 01:20:49.820
DOJ representative: Not captured in the data.

asr-001096
01:20:52.240 --> 01:20:55.250
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We need to check. We will submit, Your Honor.

asr-001097
01:20:55.270 --> 01:20:57.200
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Well, yeah, yeah.

asr-001098
01:20:57.320 --> 01:21:01.180
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Kasi the data would seem to be parang...

asr-001099
01:21:01.200 --> 01:21:03.820
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Kaya ako po tinatanong yung, Secretary,

asr-001100
01:21:03.840 --> 01:21:09.300
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ay dahil sa experience ko, hindi lang sa drug cases, pati na rin sa corruption cases.

asr-001101
01:21:09.320 --> 01:21:12.340
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Yung isang lusot na ginagamit ng mga corrupt at ng

asr-001102
01:21:12.360 --> 01:21:19.940
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: mga criminal, ay they will influence, intimidate, or purchase the witnesses for the prosecution,

asr-001103
01:21:19.960 --> 01:21:24.180
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: hindi na sila haharap, at kung hindi naka-capture yan ng PSR,

asr-001104
01:21:24.200 --> 01:21:28.340
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: then malaking bagay po iyon na hindi natin namo-monitor,

asr-001105
01:21:28.360 --> 01:21:33.710
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: which I think is very important for the DOJ to monitor.

asr-001106
01:21:33.730 --> 01:21:35.660
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Completely agree with that, Your Honor.

asr-001107
01:21:35.680 --> 01:21:37.240
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We will do that, Your Honor.

asr-001108
01:21:37.260 --> 01:21:39.060
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001109
01:21:39.080 --> 01:21:42.740
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: I think I have a minute and 18 seconds left.

asr-001110
01:21:42.760 --> 01:21:46.420
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Nabanggit niyo kanina na hindi lang naman ninyo trabaho yung anti-corruption,

asr-001111
01:21:46.440 --> 01:21:48.340
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: and tama-tama po kayo doon.

asr-001112
01:21:48.360 --> 01:21:54.540
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: It's also the job of the Office of the Ombudsman, as well as the Anti-Money Laundering Council, among others.

asr-001113
01:21:54.560 --> 01:21:56.500
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Kayo po ba ay nag-uusap?

asr-001114
01:21:56.520 --> 01:22:05.580
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Do you have a coordination committee or anything like that that discusses, for example, budget that all of you need,

asr-001115
01:22:05.600 --> 01:22:10.620
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: that discusses things that are needed by the government,

asr-001116
01:22:10.640 --> 01:22:11.700
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: beyond yung particular...

asr-001117
01:22:11.720 --> 01:22:14.900
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: department po ninyo, DOJ?

asr-001118
01:22:14.920 --> 01:22:18.020
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: What we have now, our engagement with the Office of the Ombudsman,

asr-001119
01:22:18.040 --> 01:22:21.500
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: is an existing memorandum of agreement

asr-001120
01:22:21.520 --> 01:22:25.460
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: relative to investigation of cases and filing of cases

asr-001121
01:22:25.480 --> 01:22:29.540
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: for those salary grade 27 and above

asr-001122
01:22:29.560 --> 01:22:32.380
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: for the Office of the Ombudsman and those below

asr-001123
01:22:32.400 --> 01:22:35.340
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: to be handled by the Department of Justice.

asr-001124
01:22:35.360 --> 01:22:39.620
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ang isa pa ho naming engagement with the Office of the Ombudsman now is

asr-001125
01:22:39.640 --> 01:22:44.340
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: the possibility of coming up with a code on anti-corruption.

asr-001126
01:22:44.360 --> 01:22:52.300
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: This would basically be seeing the learnings that we saw in the recent past,

asr-001127
01:22:52.320 --> 01:22:58.540
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: kung paano natin talaga mas mapapatibay yung mga batas natin on anti-corruption.

asr-001128
01:22:58.560 --> 01:23:01.020
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We have an ongoing engagement on that.

asr-001129
01:23:01.040 --> 01:23:03.460
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We have a technical working group, Your Honors,

asr-001130
01:23:03.480 --> 01:23:07.980
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: on possibly doing work on possible legislation

asr-001131
01:23:08.000 --> 01:23:11.700
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: on coming up with a code on anti-corruption, Your Honors.

asr-001132
01:23:11.720 --> 01:23:15.020
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: So bale, sa kasalukuyan ay ad hoc lang po

asr-001133
01:23:15.040 --> 01:23:19.780
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ang pakikipag-usap ninyo ng AMLA at ng OMB.

asr-001134
01:23:19.800 --> 01:23:25.860
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Kaya ako tinatanong yan, because way back in, I think it was 2006,

asr-001135
01:23:25.880 --> 01:23:32.300
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: I was informed, I learned that there was a study made of the corruption cases

asr-001136
01:23:32.320 --> 01:23:37.380
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: that went through the Sandiganbayan, at ang nalaman po nila noon

asr-001137
01:23:37.400 --> 01:23:43.300
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ay out of 110 persons convicted of graft and corruption cases,

asr-001138
01:23:43.320 --> 01:23:51.340
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: sa sampu lang, only 10 were found to have been actually inside the jail serving their sentence.

asr-001139
01:23:51.360 --> 01:23:56.380
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Ito po yung mga convicted of graft and corruption by final judgment.

asr-001140
01:23:56.400 --> 01:24:01.860
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Now, is there, to your knowledge, may I just finish my question, Mr. Chair?

asr-001141
01:24:01.880 --> 01:24:06.540
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: To your knowledge, is there any centralized system or database

asr-001142
01:24:06.560 --> 01:24:14.100
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: of the government that is there to keep track na kung yung isang tao ay na-convict ng graft and corruption?

asr-001143
01:24:14.120 --> 01:24:23.540
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Kahit sabihin natin, ibang mga criminal cases, at in-appeal niya yung kanyang conviction,

asr-001144
01:24:23.560 --> 01:24:29.820
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: later na-affirm yung kanyang conviction, namu-monitor ba natin kung talagang nakukulong yung nakonvict?

asr-001145
01:24:29.840 --> 01:24:35.660
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Kaya ako po, let me just finish. The reason I ask is because not one agency can keep track of this.

asr-001146
01:24:35.680 --> 01:24:43.660
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Hindi kaya ng DOJ yan, hindi kaya ng Ombudsman, hindi kaya ng NBP or ng ating nasa DILG.

asr-001147
01:24:43.680 --> 01:24:49.780
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: So, shouldn't there be a consolidated effort by our government?

asr-001148
01:24:49.800 --> 01:24:56.780
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Because sayang naman yung milyong-milyones na ginagastos niyo pang-prosecute ng isang tao kung hindi naman pala nakukulong?

asr-001149
01:24:56.800 --> 01:24:57.340
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Hindi po ba?

asr-001150
01:24:57.360 --> 01:25:04.380
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yes, I completely agree po. Sa particular directive or legal framework should be brought out

asr-001152
01:25:04.400 --> 01:25:12.420
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: so that those... I completely agree, Your Honor. Ang isa po namin, from our end, which I've initiated po,

asr-001153
01:25:12.440 --> 01:25:23.180
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: we just had a meeting with my regional prosecutors and si PG Dong, is basically to monitor yung mga sinampahan namin ng kaso,

asr-001154
01:25:23.200 --> 01:25:32.940
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: alin yung mga naka-archive doon, dahil at large yung mga akusado. That's something we can look within the DOJ.

asr-001155
01:25:32.960 --> 01:25:37.580
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kaya po, nasa poder ko po yun. Pero I completely agree with you, Your Honor.

asr-001156
01:25:37.600 --> 01:25:45.420
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We need to look at yung mga convictions, kung sino talaga yung nahatulan ng sentensya at nakakulong.

asr-001157
01:25:45.440 --> 01:25:52.580
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you so much, Secretary Vida. Sana kayo po ang maging pambato nitong talagang kinakailangan natin pagdating sa corruption.

asr-001158
01:25:52.600 --> 01:25:55.160
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you so much, Chair Mike.

asr-001159
01:25:55.180 --> 01:26:02.000
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you po, Representative Chel Diokno. Next in line from the majority, Representative Brian Poe.

asr-001160
01:26:03.880 --> 01:26:11.270
Rep. Brian Poe: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Mr. Chair, I'd like to start with some questions for the NBI.

asr-001161
01:26:11.270 --> 01:26:26.060
Rep. Brian Poe: Mr. Chair, I want to ask the NBI, if the NBI has any funding for representatives or attaches in embassies abroad.

asr-001162
01:26:26.060 --> 01:26:34.510
Rep. Brian Poe: Based on RA 10867, Section 7F, the NBI is allowed to have an attaché or representative.

asr-001164
01:26:35.560 --> 01:26:41.900
Rep. Brian Poe: However, the funding, according to the law, must come from the NBI.

asr-001165
01:26:41.900 --> 01:26:47.180
Rep. Brian Poe: I want to ask if in this year's budget, is there an allocation for the NBI?

asr-001166
01:26:47.400 --> 01:26:57.740
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Wala po. And I'm very thankful that you raised that issue because that is one of the future plans that the NBI is looking at,

asr-001167
01:26:57.740 --> 01:27:02.430
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: that we put NBI attachés in at least yung selected po muna na mga areas.

asr-001168
01:27:02.430 --> 01:27:04.310
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Because dito po sa atin, sa Pilipinas.

asr-001169
01:27:04.310 --> 01:27:11.830
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Yung mga embassies from Europe and the U.S. Embassy itself, meron po silang mga counterparts.

asr-001170
01:27:11.830 --> 01:27:14.650
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: It's been helping us to address transnational crimes.

asr-001171
01:27:14.650 --> 01:27:17.470
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: So thank you for raising that issue.

asr-001172
01:27:17.470 --> 01:27:22.170
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: And kasama po sana sa wish list namin iyan na mapalagay po.

asr-001173
01:27:22.170 --> 01:27:27.810
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: And I'll take advantage also to request because we want to increase the number of agents.

asr-001174
01:27:27.810 --> 01:27:31.560
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Because if we will comply with that, we need additional agents.

asr-001175
01:27:31.560 --> 01:27:36.260
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Right now, for the benefit of this committee po and everybody,

asr-001176
01:27:36.260 --> 01:27:43.780
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: I'd like to tell you that ang NBI agents po namin sa buong Pilipinas is only about 300 persons lang po.

asr-001177
01:27:45.660 --> 01:27:50.580
Rep. Brian Poe: Mr. Chair, this is quite alarming, no?

asr-001178
01:27:50.580 --> 01:27:59.430
Rep. Brian Poe: Na our NBI doesn't have funding for any international agents or representatives to be attached to any of our embassies.

asr-001179
01:27:59.430 --> 01:28:01.390
Rep. Brian Poe: Mr. Chair, if I could remind the committee.

asr-001180
01:28:01.390 --> 01:28:05.330
Rep. Brian Poe: If I could remind the committee of all the responsibilities of the NBI going after

asr-001181
01:28:05.330 --> 01:28:12.210
Rep. Brian Poe: POGOs, scam networks, cyber fraud, online gambling, Interpol cases, human trafficking,

asr-001182
01:28:12.210 --> 01:28:16.150
Rep. Brian Poe: online sexual exploitation of children, the list goes on.

asr-001183
01:28:16.150 --> 01:28:22.050
Rep. Brian Poe: And yet we haven't given a single centavo for a single attaché representative abroad.

asr-001184
01:28:22.050 --> 01:28:25.000
Rep. Brian Poe: That's absolutely ridiculous, Mr. Chair.

asr-001185
01:28:25.000 --> 01:28:30.900
Rep. Brian Poe: And I feel that it's something that we should look into as we continue on this.

asr-001186
01:28:30.900 --> 01:28:34.830
Rep. Brian Poe: This deliberation on the appropriations for the Department of Justice.

asr-001187
01:28:34.830 --> 01:28:42.700
Rep. Brian Poe: Because, as our colleague here Representative Chel Diokno was saying about accountability and investigation,

asr-001188
01:28:42.700 --> 01:28:50.560
Rep. Brian Poe: how are we supposed to go after international fugitives if we don't even have funding for NBI representatives abroad?

asr-001189
01:28:50.560 --> 01:28:56.460
Rep. Brian Poe: Mr. Chair, I feel that this is one thing that we should take into consideration for this budget season.

asr-001190
01:28:56.460 --> 01:28:59.410
Rep. Brian Poe: Thank you, NBI Director po.

asr-001191
01:29:00.400 --> 01:29:09.250
Rep. Brian Poe: Next is I'd like to ask about what we're doing for our kababayans who don't have access to legal aid.

asr-001192
01:29:09.250 --> 01:29:16.130
Rep. Brian Poe: I believe meron tayong, and we were able to fund it last year, I believe, around 8 million pesos more or less

asr-001193
01:29:16.130 --> 01:29:22.030
Rep. Brian Poe: for the DOJ Action Center or yung tinatawag natin Katarungan Caravan.

asr-001194
01:29:22.030 --> 01:29:29.900
Rep. Brian Poe: Based on my numbers, and correct me if I'm wrong, Mr. Secretary, you're currently at around 15,000 people who have been

asr-001195
01:29:29.900 --> 01:29:31.870
Rep. Brian Poe: served so far in 2026.

asr-001196
01:29:31.870 --> 01:29:37.770
Rep. Brian Poe: This is well on its way to surpassing the numbers from last year of 25,000 served.

asr-001197
01:29:37.770 --> 01:29:38.750
Rep. Brian Poe: Is this correct?

asr-001198
01:29:39.730 --> 01:29:41.700
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001199
01:29:41.700 --> 01:29:44.660
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Basically, this is the access to legal services.

asr-001200
01:29:44.660 --> 01:29:52.550
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: But of course, the primary agency is the Public Attorney's Office, na nagpapasalamat kami.

asr-001201
01:29:52.550 --> 01:29:56.490
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Pero nakita po natin kasi yung puwang sa serbisyo.

asr-001202
01:29:56.900 --> 01:30:06.170
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: At siguro, ang lagi ko hong binibigay niyan—I was interviewed—bakit naging verb yung Tulfo?

asr-001203
01:30:06.900 --> 01:30:14.030
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: 'Ipapa-Tulfo kita.' And I give credit to the Tulfo siblings kasi meron pong kulang na serbisyo.

asr-001204
01:30:14.740 --> 01:30:21.470
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: At ito po yung pilit na pinupunuan. Kabahagi po dito yung DOJ Katarungan Caravan.

asr-001205
01:30:21.470 --> 01:30:30.740
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Sa atin pong pag-ikot sa buong Pilipinas para ilapit yung serbisyo on legal services sa ating mga kababayan,

asr-001206
01:30:30.860 --> 01:30:34.640
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: nakita natin na meron talagang puwang na pwedeng punuan.

asr-001207
01:30:35.290 --> 01:30:42.180
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Pero para ho maging resilient at saka maging permanent po yung sistema ng serbisyo,

asr-001208
01:30:43.300 --> 01:30:49.850
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: ang plano po natin ay, maliban na lang siya na parang ad hoc o task force, yung DOJ Katarungan Caravan

asr-001209
01:30:49.850 --> 01:30:53.220
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: maging permanente ito sa bawat opisina ng DOJ.

asr-001210
01:30:53.930 --> 01:31:00.360
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ito po yung sa ating 250 prosecutorial offices nationwide na na-establish.

asr-001211
01:31:00.500 --> 01:31:06.000
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: ang pinipilit po namin ngayon ay mag-set up kami ng protocols on this legal service

asr-001212
01:31:06.000 --> 01:31:12.960
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: para po yung bawat opisina sa bawat probinsya, sa bawat city at sa bawat region

asr-001213
01:31:12.960 --> 01:31:18.240
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: ay may madudulugan na yung ating mga kababayan. Yung serbisyo,

asr-001214
01:31:19.430 --> 01:31:20.650
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: yung puwang na iyon na free legal service.

asr-001215
01:31:21.340 --> 01:31:24.650
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kaya nga po sa pagdedesign namin ng mga opisina ngayon, Your Honor,

asr-001216
01:31:25.230 --> 01:31:31.790
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: pinipilit namin na kasama natin sa design yung DOJ Action Center

asr-001217
01:31:31.790 --> 01:31:37.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: or ang gusto nga ho namin sanang matawag ito ay para ho may ownership yung mga kababayan natin

asr-001218
01:31:37.140 --> 01:31:40.350
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: ay DOJ Katarungan Office o DOJKO.

asr-001219
01:31:40.900 --> 01:31:44.910
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kasi sa dulo po itong serbisyong ito sa kababayan naman natin ito

asr-001220
01:31:44.910 --> 01:31:47.530
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: para ho mas mapalapit natin yung serbisyo, Your Honor.

asr-001221
01:31:49.670 --> 01:31:52.010
Rep. Brian Poe: Mr. Chair,

asr-001222
01:31:52.080 --> 01:31:55.680
Rep. Brian Poe: I was asking about this program kasi para sa mga kababayan natin,

asr-001223
01:31:55.880 --> 01:31:59.270
Rep. Brian Poe: malaking gastos po to go to their lawyers,

asr-001224
01:31:59.460 --> 01:32:04.000
Rep. Brian Poe: to go to centers of commerce where they can access legal services.

asr-001225
01:32:04.000 --> 01:32:07.800
Rep. Brian Poe: Kaya maganda yung programa ng DOJ and the fact that the DOJ, I believe,

asr-001226
01:32:07.920 --> 01:32:12.000
Rep. Brian Poe: has opened around nine new Katarungan regional centers.

asr-001227
01:32:13.160 --> 01:32:16.320
Rep. Brian Poe: Are we going to be opening more in the years to come?

asr-001228
01:32:16.390 --> 01:32:18.020
Rep. Brian Poe: Do we have funding for this, Secretary?

asr-001229
01:32:18.440 --> 01:32:19.000
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yes.

asr-001230
01:32:19.400 --> 01:32:20.310
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: This is part.

asr-001231
01:32:20.350 --> 01:32:25.100
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Actually, yung ating optimization plan for the Department of Justice

asr-001232
01:32:25.100 --> 01:32:30.310
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: so that it's rather than a secretary-initiated program,

asr-001233
01:32:31.150 --> 01:32:34.460
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: inilatag na po namin ito sa DBM

asr-001234
01:32:34.460 --> 01:32:40.540
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: for the optimization plan for the Department of Justice

asr-001235
01:32:40.540 --> 01:32:45.970
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: para may kaukulang plantilya, may kaukulang resources

asr-001236
01:32:45.970 --> 01:32:49.520
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: para nga po yung 250 field offices natin

asr-001237
01:32:49.520 --> 01:32:51.990
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: magkaroon po ng ganitong serbisyo.

asr-001238
01:32:52.600 --> 01:32:55.400
Rep. Brian Poe: Mr. Chair, the reason why I'm bringing this up also is

asr-001239
01:32:55.400 --> 01:32:58.450
Rep. Brian Poe: because with such a limited budget of only around 8 million pesos

asr-001240
01:32:58.450 --> 01:33:00.120
Rep. Brian Poe: under the office of the Secretary

asr-001241
01:33:00.120 --> 01:33:04.170
Rep. Brian Poe: for the Katarungan Caravan and the DOJ Action Center,

asr-001242
01:33:04.520 --> 01:33:08.180
Rep. Brian Poe: they've been able to help more than 15,000 people as of date now.

asr-001243
01:33:08.550 --> 01:33:12.150
Rep. Brian Poe: They're on track to help more than 25,000 people by the end of the year.

asr-001244
01:33:12.490 --> 01:33:14.180
Rep. Brian Poe: Mr. Chair, you realize that per person,

asr-001245
01:33:14.180 --> 01:33:16.060
Rep. Brian Poe: that means that the government is only,

asr-001246
01:33:16.060 --> 01:33:20.170
Rep. Brian Poe: spending about 250 to 300 pesos per person for legal assistance.

asr-001247
01:33:20.390 --> 01:33:24.770
Rep. Brian Poe: The average lawyer would charge you more than 1,000 to 3,000 pesos an hour.

asr-001248
01:33:25.410 --> 01:33:28.850
Rep. Brian Poe: The government is doing good for the people with such a limited fund.

asr-001249
01:33:29.140 --> 01:33:31.010
Rep. Brian Poe: I'm hoping that in this year's budget,

asr-001250
01:33:31.240 --> 01:33:33.930
Rep. Brian Poe: we will be able to increase the Secretary's capability

asr-001251
01:33:33.930 --> 01:33:35.880
Rep. Brian Poe: to touch base with the poorest of the poor

asr-001252
01:33:35.880 --> 01:33:37.500
Rep. Brian Poe: and help them with legal services.

asr-001253
01:33:37.980 --> 01:33:38.940
Rep. Brian Poe: And with that, Mr. Chair,

asr-001254
01:33:38.940 --> 01:33:42.510
Rep. Brian Poe: I only have one last set of questions.

asr-001255
01:33:42.790 --> 01:33:44.570
Rep. Brian Poe: I have a question for the Public Attorney's Office.

asr-001256
01:33:44.570 --> 01:33:46.360
Rep. Brian Poe: So, for PAO.

asr-001257
01:33:46.360 --> 01:33:50.810
Rep. Brian Poe: For PAO, this is really the bedrock of our public service.

asr-001258
01:33:50.810 --> 01:33:55.270
Rep. Brian Poe: I believe currently our goal is one attorney, one court.

asr-001259
01:33:55.270 --> 01:34:06.880
Rep. Brian Poe: Are we able to uphold that with our current budget?

