Rep. Allan U. Ty: How much has been released?

asr-002316
02:23:46.753 --> 02:24:02.160
Bureau of Immigration budget representative: Your Honor, as stated, the original amount was 1.9, but we have a savings of 400.

asr-002317
02:24:02.160 --> 02:24:04.115
