Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: May I interject, Mr. Chairman?

asr-002477
02:33:29.325 --> 02:33:36.790
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: On the issue of just compensation, related to the question, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002478
02:33:36.800 --> 02:33:41.454
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, Congressman Domogan, it's the time of Cong. Chungalao.

asr-002479
02:33:41.753 --> 02:33:45.454
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There are a lot of other interpellators waiting.

asr-002480
02:33:45.810 --> 02:33:49.847
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Maybe we can bring it up on your time.

asr-002481
02:33:49.847 --> 02:33:50.595
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May time pa siya.

asr-002482
02:33:54.548 --> 02:33:57.950
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Maybe you can bring it up on your time, Congressman Domogan.

asr-002483
02:33:57.960 --> 02:34:01.790
Rep. Mauricio G. Domogan: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002484
02:34:01.800 --> 02:34:04.115
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Cong. Sol Chungalao.

