Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: With the indulgence of Cong Sarah Elago, we needed to...

asr-002486
02:34:08.497 --> 02:34:17.110
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At least let Cong. Tinio come first because he has other obligations to go to.

asr-002487
