Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair, thank you.

asr-002488
02:34:18.010 --> 02:34:22.378
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Unang-una, nagpapasalamat ako kay Congresswoman Sarah Elago for being so generous and yielding her time.

asr-002489
02:34:22.378 --> 02:34:24.521
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I thought I was going to ask questions after Congressman Ty.

asr-002490
02:34:24.603 --> 02:34:25.411
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Apparently not.

asr-002491
02:34:26.960 --> 02:34:29.332
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Anyway, a few questions here.

asr-002492
02:34:29.581 --> 02:34:35.501
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Unang-una, doon ho tayo kay Administrator Benitez

asr-002493
02:34:36.947 --> 02:34:44.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng Parole and Probation Administration. Meron ho kayong panukalang batas na itinutulak dito sa Kongreso para i-modernize ang PPA.

asr-002494
02:34:45.690 --> 02:34:50.051
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At iyan ay bilang tugon sa mga problemang hinaharap ng PPA, tama po ba?

asr-002495
02:34:51.000 --> 02:34:53.957
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: With the indulgence of the Secretary, yes, sir.

asr-002496
02:34:54.723 --> 02:34:58.425
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Maaari ho bang i-outline lang o banggitin ano iyong mga problemang iyon?

asr-002497
02:34:59.520 --> 02:35:03.549
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: Ang problema po namin ay tungkol sa modernization.

asr-002498
02:35:03.765 --> 02:35:05.180
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: Mga entry-level salaries

asr-002499
02:35:05.180 --> 02:35:07.519
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: Entry-level salaries.

asr-002500
02:35:08.148 --> 02:35:09.111
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: ng aming probation

asr-002501
02:35:09.131 --> 02:35:09.780
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: officers ay mababa.

asr-002502
02:35:09.780 --> 02:35:12.983
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: parang 30 years

asr-002503
02:35:12.983 --> 02:35:13.986
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: behind po kami

asr-002504
02:35:13.986 --> 02:35:16.167
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: sa SG level nila

asr-002505
02:35:16.167 --> 02:35:18.152
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: bukod po dyan

asr-002506
02:35:18.152 --> 02:35:20.943
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: Bukod po diyan, meron po kayong mga kliyente.

asr-002507
02:35:20.943 --> 02:35:22.830
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: pag sinasabing kliente tinutukoy po

asr-002508
02:35:22.830 --> 02:35:24.678
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: natin dyan yung mga probationers

asr-002509
02:35:24.678 --> 02:35:26.958
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: natin diyan iyong mga probationers, parolees, conditional pardonees

asr-002510
02:35:26.958 --> 02:35:28.628
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: at qualified offenders.

asr-002511
02:35:28.628 --> 02:35:29.257
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tama po ba?

asr-002512
02:35:30.240 --> 02:35:32.930
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: meron po bang ideal ratio

asr-002513
02:35:32.930 --> 02:35:34.427
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa classroom

asr-002514
02:35:34.427 --> 02:35:35.661
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: may ratio na ideal

asr-002515
02:35:35.661 --> 02:35:38.816
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: one teacher to 30 students

asr-002516
02:35:38.816 --> 02:35:40.131
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ano po ba yung ideal ratio?

asr-002517
02:35:41.203 --> 02:35:42.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for the information of the committee

asr-002518
02:35:42.720 --> 02:35:44.256
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: last 2025

asr-002519
02:35:44.256 --> 02:35:47.077
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: we processed 175,000

asr-002520
02:35:48.045 --> 02:35:49.560
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: probationers

asr-002521
02:35:49.560 --> 02:35:51.104
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ilan po yung staff?

asr-002522
02:35:51.847 --> 02:35:52.824
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: yung staff po namin

asr-002523
02:35:52.824 --> 02:35:54.329
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: more or less mga

asr-002524
02:35:54.329 --> 02:35:56.381
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: 875

asr-002525
02:35:56.381 --> 02:35:58.570
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: ang case load ng isang

asr-002526
02:35:58.570 --> 02:36:00.583
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: probation officer ay

asr-002527
02:36:00.583 --> 02:36:01.853
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: 1 is to 400

asr-002528
02:36:01.853 --> 02:36:04.824
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 1 is to 400, ano po yung ideal ratio

asr-002529
02:36:04.824 --> 02:36:05.664
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa pagkakaalam ninyo?

asr-002530
02:36:05.664 --> 02:36:07.755
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: ideal ratio po ay 1 is to 50

asr-002531
02:36:07.755 --> 02:36:09.846
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sino po nagsabi ng ideal ratio na yan?

asr-002532
02:36:10.355 --> 02:36:11.488
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: UNODC po,

asr-002533
02:36:11.488 --> 02:36:13.638
PPA Administrator Bienvenido E. Benitez Jr.: United Nations Office on Drugs and Crime.

asr-002534
02:36:13.638 --> 02:36:15.925
