02:42:13.639 --> 02:42:15.550
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Nagpapalipad po tayo ng mga PAO lawyers

asr-002717
02:42:15.550 --> 02:42:16.593
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: pag may caravan.

asr-002718
02:42:17.164 --> 02:42:19.291
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Tumutulong din po tayo sa katarungan

asr-002719
02:42:19.291 --> 02:42:21.693
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: pambarangay caravan ng ating DOJ,

asr-002720
02:42:21.851 --> 02:42:22.776
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Serbisyo Caravan.

asr-002721
02:42:23.525 --> 02:42:25.533
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Napakaraming pong gawa ng ating PAO.

asr-002722
02:42:25.651 --> 02:42:27.089
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Meron din tayong legal counseling

asr-002723
02:42:27.089 --> 02:42:29.157
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: by text, messenger, viber.

asr-002724
02:42:29.767 --> 02:42:31.913
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Nagbibigay po tayo ng 500 pesos

asr-002725
02:42:31.913 --> 02:42:33.469
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: per month para sa ating lawyers

asr-002726
02:42:33.469 --> 02:42:35.576
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: para makapag-counseling din sila

asr-002727
02:42:35.576 --> 02:42:36.580
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: via social media.

asr-002728
02:42:36.600 --> 02:42:37.958
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero hindi po nakumbinsi ang DBM, ano?

asr-002729
02:42:39.399 --> 02:42:40.262
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Nakaintindihan po namin

asr-002730
02:42:40.262 --> 02:42:41.504
