asr-002731
02:42:41.504 --> 02:42:43.524
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: pero nakita natin iyong PAO kanina

asr-002732
02:42:43.524 --> 02:42:45.818
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: parang kudlit lang ang budget

asr-002733
02:42:45.818 --> 02:42:46.660
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: ng DOJ

asr-002734
02:42:46.660 --> 02:42:50.090
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: at nakiki-commiserate po ako sa mga kasama

asr-002735
02:42:50.090 --> 02:42:51.942
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: ko sa DOJ, gaya ng NBI,

asr-002736
02:42:52.973 --> 02:42:54.552
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: PPA, mga nabawasan,

asr-002737
02:42:54.741 --> 02:42:55.667
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: sana po ibalik.

asr-002738
02:42:56.193 --> 02:42:57.940
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Lalo ang NBI, gusto ko pong sana

asr-002739
02:42:57.940 --> 02:43:00.381
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: dagdagan po ng intel dahil napakasipag

asr-002740
02:43:00.381 --> 02:43:01.539
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: po ng mga NBI natin.

asr-002741
02:43:01.560 --> 02:43:04.138
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ay, masipag po talaga yan. Dapat talagang lakihin ang kanilang pondo.

asr-002742
02:43:04.138 --> 02:43:04.925
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Agree po ako diyan.

asr-002743
