Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: We in Gabriela Women's Party likewise express grave concern over the proposed massive budget cuts in the budget of the Special Enforcement and Protection Subprogram,

asr-002826
02:49:38.908 --> 02:49:45.415
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: particularly in anti-trafficking in persons enforcement, anti-cybercrime enforcement, as well as the NCC-OSAEC-CSAEM.

asr-002828
02:49:45.415 --> 02:49:52.379
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Now, Mr. Chair, may we know the 2027 proposed funding for these particular programs?

asr-002829
02:49:52.379 --> 02:50:08.967
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Natalakay po kanina kung magkano yung gusto nating ma-restore na cuts, pero gusto ko lang din ho malaman kung magkano ba yung kinakailangan para maabot yung mga kinakailangan nilang magawa para sa susunod na taon.

asr-002830
02:50:08.967 --> 02:50:13.641
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalong-lalo na hindi naman po bumababa ang mga kaso.

