DOJ Assistant Secretary Michelle Anne Lapuz: So it is our proposal or request that

asr-002840
02:51:17.657 --> 02:51:25.947
DOJ Assistant Secretary Michelle Anne Lapuz: we increase this by 75.9 million to restore to the 2026 levels.

asr-002841
