DOJ Assistant Secretary Michelle Anne Lapuz: So we're requesting...

asr-002844
02:51:47.594 --> 02:51:55.884
DOJ Assistant Secretary Michelle Anne Lapuz: for more or less 50 million, or 49 million to be exact.

asr-002845
