asr-002852
02:52:34.200 --> 02:52:41.619
DOJ Assistant Secretary Michelle Anne Lapuz: As to your ask, Mr. Chair, for the original proposed budget for

asr-002853
02:52:41.619 --> 02:52:50.754
DOJ Assistant Secretary Michelle Anne Lapuz: 2027: for the original proposed budget po, we were constrained to limit our proposals, Madam

