Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: in charge are limited to impose a particular ceiling based on the 2026 GAA on their

asr-002860
02:53:20.655 --> 02:53:29.436
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: proposals. Hindi ba dapat na, kumbaga, kung ano yung mga kailangan at yung mga dapat para magawa

asr-002861
02:53:29.436 --> 02:53:31.922
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung trabaho ninyo, iyon

asr-002862
02:53:31.922 --> 02:53:36.830
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung ipo-propose natin? Anyhow, meron pa namang pagdadaanan na

asr-002863
02:53:36.830 --> 02:53:43.190
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: DBM, no? Para, kumbaga, kung ano lang yung batay sa utilization, kung

