asr-005631
05:00:05.063 --> 05:00:09.856
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The E-Gates project is different from the Enhanced Border Control System

asr-005632
05:00:09.856 --> 05:00:14.119
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: that is being proposed under the Public-Private Partnership arrangement.

asr-005633
05:00:16.224 --> 05:00:18.541
Rep. Allan U. Ty: May we request everyone to please settle down?

asr-005634
05:00:21.680 --> 05:00:23.378
Rep. Allan U. Ty: So can you make the distinction, Commissioner?

asr-005635
05:00:23.803 --> 05:00:26.120
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Your Honor, with the E-Gates project,

asr-005636
05:00:26.120 --> 05:00:31.745
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: we aim to integrate that with the CAIS project.

asr-005637
05:00:31.745 --> 05:00:34.398
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The CAIS project is a more holistic approach

asr-005638
05:00:34.398 --> 05:00:36.803
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: because it does not only pertain to the E-Gates,

asr-005639
05:00:37.051 --> 05:00:40.712
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: but also to our integration with the systems of Interpol,

asr-005640
05:00:41.137 --> 05:00:43.542
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: as well as the Advanced Passenger Information System,

asr-005641
05:00:44.002 --> 05:00:45.842
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: and biometrics.

asr-005642
05:00:46.142 --> 05:00:51.926
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We also can log in to a billion facial images.

asr-005645
05:00:52.634 --> 05:00:55.410
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And we also have, under the CAIS program,

asr-005646
05:00:55.976 --> 05:01:02.362
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: the reactive screening based on facial contortions

asr-005647
05:01:02.910 --> 05:01:06.023
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: or in reaction to certain forms of questioning.

asr-005648
05:01:06.430 --> 05:01:09.348
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And we can also access open source intelligence.

asr-005649
05:01:09.808 --> 05:01:13.841
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Not only can we access the 194 countries that are members of Interpol,

asr-005650
05:01:13.876 --> 05:01:14.584
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: their databases,

asr-005651
05:01:14.584 --> 05:01:16.176
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: we can access that.

asr-005652
05:01:16.600 --> 05:01:19.006
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: But also, we can access,

asr-005653
05:01:19.165 --> 05:01:22.030
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: we can access any information from open sources,

asr-005654
05:01:22.189 --> 05:01:23.197
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: meaning over the internet.

asr-005655
05:01:24.206 --> 05:01:26.045
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Facebook, that can be accessed, Your Honor.

asr-005656
05:01:26.841 --> 05:01:28.663
Rep. Allan U. Ty: So this is under the PPP program?

asr-005657
05:01:28.840 --> 05:01:29.317
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-005658
05:01:29.583 --> 05:01:31.741
Rep. Allan U. Ty: Thank you, Commissioner Viado.

asr-005659
